{"id":18242,"author":"Pensiman","body":"\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"line-height: 24px;\"\u003eHey,\u003cbr\u003eafter a while of being banned on Avic.us, I would like to ask you guys if I could get unbanned again :3\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cul style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 12px 25px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cb\u003eYour minecraft\u0026nbsp;username:\u003c/b\u003e\u003ci\u003e The_Mighty_Bunny\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cb\u003eThe reason you were temp-banned/banned:\u003ci\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003ci\u003eI got banned for using speedhacks on Nebula, which was totally true.\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cb\u003eWhy you should be unbanned from the server:\u003ci\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003ci\u003eI know what I've done, and I've learned from it. I won't do it again. Also, I feel like I have been punnished enough by not being able to join the server for almost a whole year. Again, sorry for not following the rules on this awesome server.\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"line-height: 24px;\"\u003eThanks for reading,\u003cbr\u003eThe_Mighty_Bunny\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/div\u003e","body_tagged":"\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"line-height: 24px;\"\u003eHey,\u003cbr\u003eafter a while of being banned on Avic.us, I would like to ask you guys if I could get unbanned again :3\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cul style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 12px 25px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-fami